OL,3,AToxic algorithms wouldn't let them go -
OL,4,Anow Australia wants an off switch
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains an
OL,7,Faccount of living with an eating
OL,8,Fdisorder
OL,10,FVarsha Yajman was already
OL,11,Fself-conscious about the way she looked
OL,12,Fwhen she joined social media as a
OL,13,F13-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
